{"1":{"w":[{"c":"وَالشَّمْسِ","d":"wal-shamsi","e":"By the sun"},{"c":"وَضُحَاهَا","d":"waḍuḥāhā","e":"and its brightness"}],"a":{"g":"By the sun and its brightness"}},"2":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْقَمَرِ","d":"wal-qamari","e":"And the moon"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"تَلَاهَا","d":"talāhā","e":"it follows it"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the moon when it follows it"}},"3":{"w":[{"c":"وَالنَّهَارِ","d":"wal-nahāri","e":"And the day"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"جَلَّاهَا","d":"jallāhā","e":"it displays it"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the day when it displays it"}},"4":{"w":[{"c":"وَاللَّيْلِ","d":"wa-al-layli","e":"And the night"},{"c":"إِذَا","d":"idhā","e":"when"},{"c":"يَغْشَاهَا","d":"yaghshāhā","e":"it covers it"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the night when it covers it"}},"5":{"w":[{"c":"وَالسَّمَاءِ","d":"wal-samāi","e":"And the heaven"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and He Who"},{"c":"بَنَاهَا","d":"banāhā","e":"constructed it"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the sky and He who constructed it"}},"6":{"w":[{"c":"وَالْأَرْضِ","d":"wal-arḍi","e":"And the earth"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and He Who"},{"c":"طَحَاهَا","d":"ṭaḥāhā","e":"spread it"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the earth and He who spread it"}},"7":{"w":[{"c":"وَنَفْسٍ","d":"wanafsin","e":"And (the) soul"},{"c":"وَمَا","d":"wamā","e":"and He Who"},{"c":"سَوَّاهَا","d":"sawwāhā","e":"proportioned it"}],"a":{"g":"And [by] the soul and He who proportioned it"}},"8":{"w":[{"c":"فَأَلْهَمَهَا","d":"fa-alhamahā","e":"And He inspired it"},{"c":"فُجُورَهَا","d":"fujūrahā","e":"(to understand) what is wrong for it"},{"c":"وَتَقْوَاهَا","d":"wataqwāhā","e":"and what is right for it"}],"a":{"g":"And inspired it [with discernment of] its wickedness and its righteousness,"}},"9":{"w":[{"c":"قَدْ","d":"qad","e":"Indeed"},{"c":"أَفْلَحَ","d":"aflaḥa","e":"he succeeds"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"who"},{"c":"زَكَّاهَا","d":"zakkāhā","e":"purifies it"}],"a":{"g":"He has succeeded who purifies it,"}},"10":{"w":[{"c":"وَقَدْ","d":"waqad","e":"And indeed"},{"c":"خَابَ","d":"khāba","e":"he fails"},{"c":"مَنْ","d":"man","e":"who"},{"c":"دَسَّاهَا","d":"dassāhā","e":"corrupts it"}],"a":{"g":"And he has failed who instills it [with corruption]."}},"11":{"w":[{"c":"كَذَّبَتْ","d":"kadhabat","e":"Denied"},{"c":"ثَمُودُ","d":"thamūdu","e":"Thamud"},{"c":"بِطَغْوَاهَا","d":"biṭaghwāhā","e":"by their transgression"}],"a":{"g":"Thamud denied [their prophet] by reason of their transgression,"}},"12":{"w":[{"c":"إِذِ","d":"idhi","e":"When"},{"c":"انْبَعَثَ","d":"inbaʿatha","e":"(was) sent forth"},{"c":"أَشْقَاهَا","d":"ashqāhā","e":"(the) most wicked of them"}],"a":{"g":"When the most wretched of them was sent forth."}},"13":{"w":[{"c":"فَقَالَ","d":"faqāla","e":"But said"},{"c":"لَهُمْ","d":"lahum","e":"to them"},{"c":"رَسُولُ","d":"rasūlu","e":"(the) Messenger"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"نَاقَةَ","d":"nāqata","e":"(It is the) she-camel"},{"c":"اللَّهِ","d":"l-lahi","e":"(of) Allah"},{"c":"وَسُقْيَاهَا","d":"wasuq'yāhā","e":"and her drink"}],"a":{"g":"And the messenger of Allah [Salih] said to them, \"[Do not harm] the she-camel of Allah or [prevent her from] her drink.\""}},"14":{"w":[{"c":"فَكَذَّبُوهُ","d":"fakadhabūhu","e":"But they denied him"},{"c":"فَعَقَرُوهَا","d":"faʿaqarūhā","e":"and they hamstrung her"},{"c":"فَدَمْدَمَ","d":"fadamdama","e":"So destroyed"},{"c":"عَلَيْهِمْ","d":"ʿalayhim","e":"them"},{"c":"رَبُّهُمْ","d":"rabbuhum","e":"their Lord"},{"c":"بِذَنْبِهِمْ","d":"bidhanbihim","e":"for their sin"},{"c":"فَسَوَّاهَا","d":"fasawwāhā","e":"and leveled them"}],"a":{"g":"But they denied him and hamstrung her. So their Lord brought down upon them destruction for their sin and made it equal [upon all of them]."}},"15":{"w":[{"c":"وَلَا","d":"walā","e":"And not"},{"c":"يَخَافُ","d":"yakhāfu","e":"He fears"},{"c":"عُقْبَاهَا","d":"ʿuq'bāhā","e":"its consequences"}],"a":{"g":"And He does not fear the consequence thereof."}}}